 "section_summary": "This section contains weekly U.S. Army intelligence reports and State Department routing sheets from May to July 1949. The reports cover political disputes, economic conditions, military developments and subversive activity in Japan, North and South Korea, the Philippines and Okinawa. They give particular attention to North Korean military expansion and possible intervention in the South, South Korean legislative conflict, Philippine elections and Huk activity.",
